<title>UK: F van Lanschot Bankiers ups bond to 350 mln Dfl.</title>
<headline>F van Lanschot Bankiers ups bond to 350 mln Dfl.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-03</dateline>
<text>
<p>The following bond, announced earlier by lead manager Rabobank International, has been increased to 350 million guilders from 300 million guilders.</p>
<p> BORROWER   F VAN LANSCHOT BANKIERS</p>
<p> AMT    350 MLN DFL   COUPON     6.25	MATURITY    30.OCT.06</p>
<p> TYPE	 STRAIGHT  ISS PRICE  101.025   PAY DATE    30.OCT.96</p>
<p> FULL FEES  2.00	REOFFER    99.45     SPREAD	+37 BP</p>
<p> MOODY	=	   LISTING    AMST	PAY FREQ    =</p>
<p> S&amp;P	  =	   DENOMS (K) *	   SALE LIMITS US/UK/NL</p>
<p> NEG PLG    YES	 CRS DEFLT  YES	 FORCE MAJ   YES</p>
<p> GOV LAW    DUTCH     HOME CTRY  NETHER    TAX PROVS   DOMESTIC</p>
<p> MGT/UND    0.425     SELL CONC  1.575     PRAECIPUUM  =</p>
<p> NOTES    * 5(K)-10(K) K-F FORM, 5(K)-100(K)-1(M) CF-F FORM</p>
<p>-- London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
